      "order": "north to south, then all of Wales",
      "intro": "After {{yn}} (in) the first letter changes: {{gogledd}} becomes {{ngogledd}}, {{canolbarth}} becomes {{nghanolbarth}}, {{gorllewin}} becomes {{ngorllewin}} and {{de}} becomes {{ne}}. {{yn}} itself becomes {{yng}} before those sounds. The plain name of each part of Wales is listed as another way it is heard."
